            <title>[LU-19630] IPv6 conf-sanity test_43b: FAIL: start fs2mgs failed</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19630</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Cyril Bordage &amp;lt;cbordage@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/aa216538-be7d-442d-b2f0-36f2667ca43c&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/aa216538-be7d-442d-b2f0-36f2667ca43c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_43b failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;start fs2mgs failed
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118859&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118859&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.76.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118859&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118859&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.76.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test script doesn&apos;t not handle IPv6:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: trevis-94vm1.trevis.whamcloud.com /usr/sbin/lctl list_nids | grep -w tcp | cut -f 1 -d @
CMD: [fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912,fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912,fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912] hostname -I
No such rcmd module &quot;[fd33&quot;
pdsh@trevis-94vm1: Failed to register rcmd &quot;[fd33&quot; for &quot;3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912,fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912,fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:b8:4912]&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;







&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
conf-sanity test_43b - start fs2mgs failed&lt;/p&gt;</description>
